{"id":"f06a70914e63dea9","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-partition-relation.md","title":"Cardinal Partition Relation","display":"df-partition-relation — Cardinal Partition Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-partition-relation","aliases":["17-df-partition-relation"],"display":"df-partition-relation — Cardinal Partition Relation","depends_on":["[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive","source_verification":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-partition-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-partition-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partition-relation — Cardinal Partition Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu\">\\(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu\\)</span> 为基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；基数、有限序数及函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)\\)</span> 的参数依次为底集基数、齐次集基数、颜色基数、子集大小。该接口保留输入 Ramsey 与 Erdős–Rado 文件中显式写出的像集基数等于一的约定，不将边界值自动改成像集基数至多一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n[X]^n&amp;:=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall c:[\\lambda]^n\\to\\mu\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land|c[[H]^n]|=1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n[X]^n&amp;:=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall c:[\\lambda]^n\\to\\mu\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land|c[[H]^n]|=1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>实际引用定理的参数保证齐次集有相应大小的子集；“恰一个颜色”与通常的“至多一个颜色”在这些调用中等价。此处没有另加未被本册调用的划分关系版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu$ 为基数，$n\\in\\omega$；基数、有限序数及函数见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]、[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]、[[17-df-set-functions]]。$\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)$ 的参数依次为底集基数、齐次集基数、颜色基数、子集大小。该接口保留输入 Ramsey 与 Erdős–Rado 文件中显式写出的像集基数等于一的约定，不将边界值自动改成像集基数至多一。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu$ 为基数，$n\\in\\omega$；基数、有限序数及函数见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]、[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]、[[17-df-set-functions]]。$\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)$ 的参数依次为底集基数、齐次集基数、颜色基数、子集大小。该接口保留输入 Ramsey 与 Erdős–Rado 文件中显式写出的像集基数等于一的约定，不将边界值自动改成像集基数至多一。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu$ 为基数，$n\\in\\omega$；基数、有限序数及函数见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]、[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]、[[17-df-set-functions]]。$\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)$ 的参数依次为底集基数、齐次集基数、颜色基数、子集大小。该接口保留输入 Ramsey 与 Erdős–Rado 文件中显式写出的像集基数等于一的约定，不将边界值自动改成像集基数至多一。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n[X]^n&:=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu,n)\n&\\leftrightarrow\\forall c:[\\lambda]^n\\to\\mu\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land|c[[H]^n]|=1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1512,"backlinks":[{"id":"1e319d8fce454230","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\kappa$ 是无限基数，$n\\in\\omega$；基数、幂和后继基数见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。\n$\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S$ 见 [[17-df-partition-relation]]。\n$b_\\kappa$ 是下式按 $m\\in\\omega$ 递归定义的基数值函数；$\\lambda,\\mu$ 为受量化的候选集合。"},{"id":"3c1299db4f604d6f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S$ (partition-relation predicate, see [[17-df-partition-relation]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-partition-relation]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-language-operations]]\n[[17-df-lindstrom-regularity]]\n[[17-df-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]\n[[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-partition-relation]]\n[[17-df-set-functions]]\n[[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]\n[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]"}],"outgoing":["0c4dd6e6f689f962","b6e4a36b436c9b93","571123944253d721"]}